cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LocAlignR in your research, please cite this software."
title: "LocAlignR: a local Shiny application for sequence alignment using BLAST and DIAMOND"
type: software
version: "0.2.1"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Pereira Lobo"
    given-names: "Francisco"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9671-9313"
repository-code: "https://github.com/franciscolobo/LocAlignR"
url: "https://github.com/franciscolobo/LocAlignR"
abstract: >
  LocAlignR provides a graphical interface for biological sequence alignment,
  local database management, interactive visualization and reproducible search
  configurations using BLAST and DIAMOND.
keywords:
  - sequence alignment
  - BLAST
  - DIAMOND
  - Shiny
  - bioinformatics
  - reproducible research
